OL,3,GNEWSA'Utter shock' for teen who lost
OL,4,Aeye in glass attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has lost an eye after he was
OL,7,Fattacked with a bottle in Blackpool.
OL,9,FJJ Shingleton, 17, was allegedly
OL,10,Fglassed with a vodka bottle at a party
OL,11,Fin Bond Street on Saturday.
OL,13,FJJ, who is in remission from cancer,
OL,14,Fhas undergone two operations, resulting
OL,15,Fin his right eye being removed.
