OL,3,GNEWSA'Utter shock' for teen who lost
OL,4,Aeye in glass attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire Police said officers were
OL,7,Fcalled at about 01:50 BST on Sunday to
OL,8,Freports of an assault. A 19-year-old
OL,9,Fwas arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,10,Fgrievous bodily harm. He has since been
OL,11,Freleased on bail, pending further
OL,12,Fenquiries, the force added.
